WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
--------------------
Until 2026-09-27 nothing in this repository said who wrote or owned it: no
LICENSE, no NOTICE, no author field in package.json, no copyright key in the
iOS bundle, and no author header in any source file. The web footer asserted
"© 2026 ALAFIA", which names the product — a product cannot hold a copyright.

That gap was not only untidy. Apple rejected build 1.5(10) under

    Guideline 5.1.1(ix) - Legal - Privacy - Data Collection and Storage

    "The app must be published under a seller and company name that is
     associated with the organization or company providing the services."

An app handling sensitive health data has to be traceable to the organisation
behind it. Where that ownership is declared, it must be declared consistently:

    App Store Connect     seller / company name
    Google Play Console   developer name
    iOS bundle            NSHumanReadableCopyright (IOS/ALAFIA/Info.plist)
    web                   footer copyright + alafia.app/privacy
    npm                   author / license (WEB/frontend/package.json)

Android has no source-level slot for this — Gradle declares no author, so the
developer name lives only in the Play Console, exactly as the seller name lives
only in App Store Connect. Both are set outside this repository and neither can
be verified from it.


